{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01067","headline":"相和歌辞 对酒 · 崔国辅","name":"相和歌辞 对酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行行日将夕，荒村古冢无人迹。\n朦胧荆棘一鸟飞，屡唱提壶酤酒吃。\n古人不达酒不足，遗恨精灵传此曲。\n寄言当代诸少年，平生且尽杯中渌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔国辅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01067.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01067","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}